WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:04.400
Thousands of children in the Philippines
go to school on an empty stomach.

2
00:00:04.600 --> 00:00:06.400
If they can go at all.

3
00:00:06.600 --> 00:00:11.000
School fees, a meal, a bar of soap...
It's often too much.

4
00:00:11.200 --> 00:00:15.900
And when a typhoon or flood hits,
families lose everything.

5
00:00:16.100 --> 00:00:19.800
At Robin Foundation, you choose a child
to sponsor yourself.

6
00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:23.400
Every child has just one sponsor: you.

7
00:00:23.600 --> 00:00:30.700
For €50 a month, your child gets a meal every school day,
school fees and supplies, and basic hygiene.

8
00:00:30.900 --> 00:00:35.600
And €5 goes to our emergency fund,
for when a typhoon or flood strikes.

9
00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:38.600
Our field workers visit every family.

10
00:00:38.800 --> 00:00:43.800
We verify the parents' identity and all documents,
so your help really arrives.

11
00:00:44.200 --> 00:00:48.400
Every month you receive a photo,
a letter or a short video.

12
00:00:48.600 --> 00:00:52.000
And you can send messages to the parents,
translated automatically.

13
00:00:52.200 --> 00:00:54.600
Safely, through Robin Foundation.

14
00:00:56.000 --> 00:01:02.300
Together with individuals and businesses, we give children
a full stomach and a real chance at school.

15
00:01:05.500 --> 00:01:07.900
Choose a child that you want to support.
